<title>USA: Insurance Auto Q4 net down after charge.</title>
<headline>Insurance Auto Q4 net down after charge.</headline>
<dateline>PALATINE, Ill. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.01		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			     71			790</p>
<p> Revs			64,355		   67,592</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,337		   11,284</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 net includes $1.4 million special charge related to centralization of its corporate groups in Illinois. Without the special charge, net income was $866,000, or $0.08 a share.  </p>
